<title>HUNGARY: Nitroil reports rising profits for 1996.</title>
<headline>Nitroil reports rising profits for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   135.8    vs    125.1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			85.2    vs     67.4</p>
<p>    Net sales			  1,082.4    vs  1,256.0</p>
<p>    Other revenue			 38.3    vs     91.1</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	    490.2    vs    579.9</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales	  432.2    vs    535.3</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    38.9 loss vs   57.0 loss</p>
<p>     Financial revenue		   1.2    vs	1.1</p>
<p>     Financial expenditure	    40.2    vs     58.1</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	11.7 loss vs    0.6 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Nitroil Rt is a chemical engineering company.</p>
<p>The 1996 figures are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
